turn-blend
An all-in-one voice activity and end-of-turn detection model.

turn-blend.onnx contains the unmodified weights of the following third-party models. Their graphs were
converted to ONNX opset 18 where needed, renamed with a per-model prefix and joined into one graph. For
Silero VAD the published 16 kHz graph was first specialised to a fixed input shape with its control flow
folded away. No weights were retrained or altered.

